  "description": "In an era of declining birth rates, a government DNA and personality-based matching program determines romantic compatibility. Two department heads, notorious workplace rivals, are stunned to receive a perfect 100% match the rarest compatibility, even capable of same-sex pregnancy. The twist? One has secretly loved the other for ten years. Now, what was meant to end his unrequited love may reveal feelings he can no longer deny.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297092241)",
